{"id": "EUVD-2026-108856", "enisaUuid": "b784a157-136d-34c8-993b-ae985c23d279", "description": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nxen/gntalloc: validate grant count before allocation\n\ngntalloc_ioctl_alloc() allocates the grant-id array before checking\nwhether the requested count fits within the global grant limit. Counts\nabove that limit cannot succeed, so reject them before the\nuser-controlled allocation reaches kcalloc().\n\nUse a subtraction-based check while holding gref_mutex so adding the\nrequested count cannot wrap. Also cast the count before advancing the\nper-file index so the page-size multiplication is performed in 64-bit\narithmetic.", "datePublished": "2026-10-23T12:31:37", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-23T12:31:37", "baseScore": 0.0, "references": ["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/e2806390aa1c4d5b3f7a68f10a56ae12c71c00d8", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/71a0cf87e19fb35c4292ca88985e376e613c900a", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/641de086a05f349de7fc548612432bc2fed721ca", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/720554c04acba80018ded069d3e0984bebaee891", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/84d5727cef8eb9c8a28210ad248f1c70b223b065", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/231542f4e43cf9837cb520664545e85fbe666b7b", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/2299822f3f466b5dcad2377bf63986199f881a6b", "https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-98900"], "aliases": ["GHSA-mwrq-hx54-3h97", "CVE-2026-98900"], "assigner": "Linux", "epss": 0.0, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "032a9a5d-b0fc-3136-986d-41f5b5b024ea", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.6.158"}, {"id": "0a14ebf6-6b39-35a1-a963-b8c5ee0581cd", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "0 <6.18.53"}, {"id": "23d4607f-2c84-3131-994b-4a5844a7dd4e", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "1da177e4c3f41524e886b7f1b8a0c1fc7321cac2 <231542f4e43cf9837cb520664545e85fbe666b7b"}, {"i